      "finding": "Target has a detached connected broad shoulder with two raised tips, a narrow downward link and a lower button. A qamats reading resembles the literal nearby1:17 lamed qamats; a fused descending qubbuts or other saturated three-node group remains possible. The literal1:18 bet qubbuts has three separate descending dots, and1:18 hamelekh mem segol has three separate triangular dots. Neither control recovers missing white divisions in the target. The1:17 mem itself has a saturated bar-and-stem and supplies no independent qubbuts proof.",
      "proposedText": null,
