      "addressVerification": "Companion165 right = primary316. The target lies on source printedverse ד, after the printed ג row. Complete source word משלך follows נחנק and precedes בשוק; Catholic2:3 is וַיָּבֹא וַיֹּאמַר אָבִי אֶחָד מֵאַחֵינוּ נֶחֱנַק משְׁלָךְ בַּשּׁוּק׃. This exact source continuation and word, rather than identity of printed verse numbers, establishes the Catholic2:3 address. Companion164 left = primary315 contains1:17/18 word controls.",
